libheinz
------------------------------------------
C++ base library of Heinz Maier-Leibnitz Zentrum

Runtime requirements:

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://jugit.fz-juelich.de/mlz/lib/heinz

Canonical download:
  https://jugit.fz-juelich.de/mlz/lib/heinz/-/archive/v4.1.0/heinz-v4.1.0.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libheinz-4.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libheinz-4.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libheinz-4.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libheinz-4.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libheinz)
  /usr/include/heinz/Complex.h
  /usr/include/heinz/Rotations3D.h
  /usr/include/heinz/Vectors3D.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/LibHeinz/LibHeinzConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/LibHeinz/LibHeinzConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/LibHeinz/LibHeinzTargets.cmake
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libheinz.README
  /usr/share/doc/libheinz/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libheinz/README.md

------------------

